    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The N7 Valiant is a semi-automatic precision rifle developed for N7 special operations snipers who must engage hardened targets across multiple shots without the vulnerability of a bolt-action reload. Its five-round heat sink allows rapid follow-up fire while maintaining the kinetic impact necessary to defeat heavy armor. Between the Widow's devastating single shot and the Viper's rapid volume, the Valiant occupies the premium tier for operators who need both.</p>"
